{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_82267c2ab54c6270","type":"tool_result","content":"/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:45:    Fast path (``src`` and ``dst`` share sub-8B alignment): tile 0 owns the\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:47:    as u64 over the aligned interior. ``NUM_TILES=1`` collapses to a single-\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:51:    Slow path (mismatched sub-8B alignment): byte-wide tiled copy. Some\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:52:    NVIDIA parts (e.g. GB200) reject misaligned u64 loads with\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:53:    ``cudaErrorMisalignedAddress`` instead of accepting the misaligned-sector\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:54:    cost, so we can't just let the fast path run with a misaligned src.\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:143:    ``precopy_mamba_align_fused_kernel``, mirroring the V1 copy specs\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:155:    u64 range into ``TEMPORAL_TILES`` contiguous, COPY_BLOCK_SIZE-aligned\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:342:    aligned_new_computed = (new_num_computed // block_size) * block_size\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:344:    needs_copy = aligned_new_computed >= num_tokens_running_state\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:350:    accept_token_bias = aligned_new_computed - num_tokens_running_state\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:351:    dest_block_idx = aligned_new_computed // block_size - 1\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:388:def preprocess_mamba_align_fused_kernel(\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:400:    \"\"\"Fused align preprocess: emit the pre-copy src column/offset AND advance\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:401:    state_idx (with accepted-token reset) in a single launch (V2 align).\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:405:      2. Store the pre-copy src columns for ``precopy_mamba_align_fused_kernel``:\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:434:def precopy_mamba_align_fused_kernel(\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:436:    # the V2 fused align preprocess kernel for the current step:\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:460:    \"\"\"Pre-copy mamba \"align\" state across block boundaries.\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:464:    the initial state from the write-side block as usual (V1 align semantics).\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:600:    (and the mamba_cache_config is in align mode).\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:640:    # enabled (spec decode + hybrid + align mode).\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:833:                        # The kernel's head/tail handles misalignment for\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:834:                        # correctness, but unaligned base/stride costs in\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:841:                                \"8B-aligned; _memcpy_u64_tiled uint64 \"\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/worker/mamba_utils.py:842:                                \"vectorization will pay misaligned load cost\",\n/opt/envs/vllm/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vl